$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM The procedure for Eq. 7. In a glove box, a vial was charged with 3b (84
mg, 0.20 mmol), 4-iodopyridine (62 mg, 0.30 mmol), PdCl2(dppf)•CH2Cl2 (33
mg, 40 μmol) and THF (0.30 mL). Out of the glove box, 2.5 M KOH aq. (320
μL, 0.80 mmol) was added to the mixture and the resulting mixture was
stirred at 100 ºC for 11 h. After the reaction, the mixture was filtrated
through a pad of Celite and silica gel. The mixture was washed with
NaHCO3 aq. and the organic layer was dried over MgSO4. After the
filtration, all the volatiles were removed in vacuo. The product was
purified by MPLC (8 g of silica gel, hexane:ethyl acetate = 70:30 to
40:60) to give CDP840 (46 mg, 0.12 mmol, 62%). Rf 0.25 (hexane:ethyl
acetate = 2:3). 1H NMR (CDCl3, 400 MHz): δ 8.40 (d, J = 4.6 Hz, 2H),
7.29-7.25 (m, 2H), 7.20-7.17 (m, 3H), 6.98 (d, J = 5.0 Hz, 2H), 6.75 (d,
J = 8.2 Hz, 1H), 6.68 (dd, J = 8.2 Hz, 2.1 Hz, 1H), 6.65 (d, J = 2.1 Hz,
1H), 4.67-4.62 (m, 1H), 4.14 (t, J = 7.8 Hz, 1H), 3.79 (s, 3H), 3.34-3.32
(m, 2H), 1.84-1.75 (m, 6H), 1.59-1.55 (m, 2H); 13C NMR (CDCl3, 101 MHz):
δ 149.6, 149.2, 148.6, 147.3, 143.9, 135.9, 128.4, 127.7, 126.4, 124.5,
119.9, 115.3, 111.8, 80.4, 56.0, 51.5, 41.6, 32.7, 32.6, 24.0.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM thermal, glovebox used, Suzuki coupling
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Arylboration of Alkenes by Cooperative Palladium/Copper Catalysis
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Semba, Kazuhiko; Nakao, Yoshiaki
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Journal of the American Chemical Society (2014), 136(21), 7567-7570

